This package compiles ufbx, by Samuli Raivio, from the git submodule under vendor/ufbx
(tag v0.23.0). ufbx is available under the MIT License or as public domain (Unlicense);
the full text is vendor/ufbx/LICENSE. The generator reads upstream's bindgen scripts
under vendor/ufbx/bindgen, which carry the same license.

